= Propulsion system

the propulsion system uses nuclear pulse propulsion alongside a bussard ramjet to propel the spacecraft across. This is a very efficient system. In fact, NPP was briefly pioneered in the 1960s by the predecessor to NASA, NACA, although it was shut down due to _stupid international regulations_ about not launching nukes in the atmosphere/space. Obviously, this meant the project couldnt continue. Legality getting in the way as always.
